{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/58a813b07d259bb27fb6a1b3d92860a6.poster.avif?t=1768035796\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/58a813b07d259bb27fb6a1b3d92860a6.webm?t=1768035796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the heart of a forbidden land where roads end and corrupted dreams bleed into reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond broken trails and untamed terrain lies a place where the world itself unravels - an island cursed by the corpses of ever rotting gods. Uncover the story of humankind's ancestry on your expedition for occult knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not just a driver. You are a pathfinder, a witness, a courier of forgotten truths, and a trespasser in a place where remnants of humanity\u2019s original sin still fester. What you carry is more than supplies: it's survival, knowledge, and perhaps the key to awakening something that should remain buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/584be6a09b1148287a4064c09d357a55.poster.avif?t=1768035796\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/584be6a09b1148287a4064c09d357a55.webm?t=1768035796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Logistics</strong> - Plan routes, manage fuel, and complete deliveries across treacherous terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts &amp; Cargo</strong> - Keep outposts running and transport unique finds, each a fragment of humanity\u2019s forgotten hunt for the divine prey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On-Foot Exploration</strong> - Leave the safety of your truck to interact with your environment and uncover ancient secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Open World</strong> - Explore a vast, uncharted land from it's coastline to the heart of the island, warped by dreams of god-husks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade for the Unknown</strong> - Upgrade and adapt your vehicle to survive deeper incursions into corrupted lands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Document the Uncanny</strong> - Use specialized tools to identify, recover, and record artifacts born of godly decay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067370?t=1768035796","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/d8caf635c857cb5c95e17d6bda7606711a9e3d46/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768035796","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/e2deaee5db8d1e7cd9faeb18381f0437b1bb4c72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768035796","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/e2deaee5db8d1e7cd9faeb18381f0437b1bb4c72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768035796","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/58a813b07d259bb27fb6a1b3d92860a6.poster.avif?t=1768035796\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/58a813b07d259bb27fb6a1b3d92860a6.webm?t=1768035796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the heart of a forbidden land where roads end and corrupted dreams bleed into reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond broken trails and untamed terrain lies a place where the world itself unravels - an island cursed by the corpses of ever rotting gods. Uncover the story of humankind's ancestry on your expedition for occult knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not just a driver. You are a pathfinder, a witness, a courier of forgotten truths, and a trespasser in a place where remnants of humanity\u2019s original sin still fester. What you carry is more than supplies: it's survival, knowledge, and perhaps the key to awakening something that should remain buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/584be6a09b1148287a4064c09d357a55.poster.avif?t=1768035796\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/584be6a09b1148287a4064c09d357a55.webm?t=1768035796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Logistics</strong> - Plan routes, manage fuel, and complete deliveries across treacherous terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts &amp; Cargo</strong> - Keep outposts running and transport unique finds, each a fragment of humanity\u2019s forgotten hunt for the divine prey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On-Foot Exploration</strong> - Leave the safety of your truck to interact with your environment and uncover ancient secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Open World</strong> - Explore a vast, uncharted land from it's coastline to the heart of the island, warped by dreams of god-husks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade for the Unknown</strong> - Upgrade and adapt your vehicle to survive deeper incursions into corrupted lands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Document the Uncanny</strong> - Use specialized tools to identify, recover, and record artifacts born of godly decay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Code Wakers"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/67c7f778d444eb51f8b33ed641d4cdd6161a850b/header.jpg?t=1768035796","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Prospice","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 60+ fps target</li></ul>","re